### 1. Start a conversation — copy the _id from the response
POST http://localhost:3000/api/conversations

### 2. Send a message (paste the id). The reply streams back as SSE events.
POST http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/PASTE_ID_HERE/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "My name is Sita and I'm learning JavaScript." }

### 3. Send another — the server remembers the history
POST http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/PASTE_ID_HERE/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "What's my name, and what am I learning?" }

### 4. See the saved conversation
GET http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/PASTE_ID_HERE

### 5. List all conversations
GET http://localhost:3000/api/conversations
